# The README screenshot. Run with `make screenshot`, which sets up tests/ and vendor/bin/.
Output output.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Padding 24
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "vendor/bin/baretest"
Enter
Sleep 2s
